    <string name="onboarding_keyboard_tips">Samsung: Settings → General management → Keyboard list and default.\n\nEnglish autocorrect, next-word and emoji suggestions are ready to use. Personalised suggestions learn typed words on this device; turn them off in Chirp settings → Keyboard → Layouts, languages &amp; typing → Text correction. Dictation finals bypass keyboard learning.\n\n%1$s</string>
