    <string name="onboarding_mic_tips_title">Your microphone</string>
    <string name="onboarding_mic_tips">The mic opens only when you start dictation or a note and is released when you stop. Dictation history and learning from your edits are on by default, encrypted on this phone; turn history off in Settings → Privacy &amp; history, and learning off in Settings → Dictation. Notes are kept locally; keeping their audio is optional and off by default.</string>
