    <string name="onboarding_pairing_tips">Turn on Tailscale on both devices. QR scanning uses Google Play services; Chirp needs no camera permission. Pasting the link works without the scanner. The pairing is encrypted with Android Keystore, and nothing is saved until your computer answers.</string>
