    <string name="stop_info_pause">Chirp stops after you pause, judged against the room\'s background noise. It never stops before you speak, and gives up after 10 seconds of silence. Either way, dictation ends at 10 minutes.</string>
    <string name="stop_info_tap">Tap the stop button to finish. Either way, a countdown starts 15 seconds before the limit and dictation ends at 10 minutes.</string>

